{"id":"664912","name":"擂辣椒茄子皮蛋","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664912/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"茄子","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"皮蛋","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"茄子洗净切段。","img":"images/664912/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"青椒洗净备用。","img":"images/664912/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中水开放入茄子蒸十五分钟左右。","img":"images/664912/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒸至茄子用筷子可以轻易插入取出晾凉。","img":"images/664912/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"皮蛋提前煮熟晾凉。","img":"images/664912/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中底油放入青椒，小火煎至青椒断生。","img":"images/664912/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"晾凉的茄子撕细。","img":"images/664912/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"青椒也同样撕细。","img":"images/664912/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入皮蛋。","img":"images/664912/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入蒜蓉酱。","img":"images/664912/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入适量盐，芝麻油，陈醋，辣椒粉，淋上热油，翻拌均匀即可。","img":"images/664912/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664912/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664912/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}